5.3. Only use or permit the Collateral to be used in accordance with all applicable
federal, state, county and municipal laws and regulations, and in a manner consistent with any
agreements with the Union Pacific and/or BNSF Railroads; and
5.4. Have and maintain insurance at all times with respect to all Collateral against such
